"FPort requires an external bi-directional inverter attached to T2 and "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` set to 4 (half-duplex).  See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""
"FPort 需要在 T2 上外接一个双向反相器，并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 "
"4（半双工）。见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

