msgid "RSSI"
msgstr "RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:98
#: 22112c12e9334144a56941405ccc8ef5 321709f36a224991ac9dadfefdb83fef
#: 3bd3dbc53c574dffb5eae5dbe1f7c617 a1436d734b22441798c2bbb2683d7953
#: fe646e181410436f9d31a050ed7e6263
msgid ""
"ADC Pin 12 -> Analog RSSI voltage monitoring. Set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1 and :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = 12. "
"For RSSI embedded in digital RC protocols like CRSF, set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"
msgstr ""
"ADC 引脚 12 -> 模拟 RSSI 电压监测。设置 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1 和 "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = 12。对于嵌入在 CRSF 等数字遥控协议中的 RSSI，设置 "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:101
#: 1eee8cf52d264c2f976040d3b2bfb116 860613e4b6754af389af1a65f7775325
#: a6d54bb6119943bba0ac2760acc6f783 f4069282353d4c2cba149b2be9e6e07c
#: fe7ea57454f14e389e6ef8fca31b599f
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:102
#: 0e92bdc2a658419b833f6cd6720a3bb4 2f77fbcdd2f341b3a1876ac2f88dafc5
#: 4aa285d084164c88bf49681f1f9f949a a26cd9e842df4a2bbc40fbff50db2e9c
#: d6bc99b61588495cb75f09eb961c682e
msgid ""
"The DAKEFPV F405 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "DAKEFPV F405 没有内置罗盘，但你可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:105
#: 3f26fb7e2525417da0376b149023fb24 4d0aba620bec464385c721ec89b1e6a6
#: 61c74916f5664dc39aeafb4d27da8298 c1503022d42e4029a741f991bc2b0633
#: ec60e72b12774a1d8a2dae4f027082eb
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:106
#: 41754c9ed925460596735409f9e29534 6b479e1401c94799b7ac1cb6f4de1ae4
#: 79a9584f05214c138c6d37b2ffdd7e6c 7ba6998d25e948b0a22ababf33f9d8f0
#: 87330029d27748f4a41be409784e8b25
msgid ""
"The autopilot has an onboard OSD using a MAX7456 chip and is enabled by "
"default. The CAM1/2 and VTX pins provide connections for using the internal "
"OSD. Simultaneous DisplayPort OSD is also possible and is configured by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"该飞控具有基于 MAX7456 芯片的板载 OSD，默认启用。CAM1/2 和 VTX 引脚提供使用内部 OSD 的连接。同时使用 "
"DisplayPort OSD 也是可行的，且已默认配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:109
#: 289efe68cb1548ea8a9732548ab8d957 6066a521bd3c4d339b533940f5b56854
#: 7b59af2bbd8c4fb5a79b714272d6cc5f be06847d4db84d6b8e9c8f74ada5ebef
#: c4688fc486334b97b68e24f9b138661b
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:110
#: 0264255497ad414ebf9264f4da42ce88 41c0e2216a1d40b9ae39283c7e7302a7
#: 7e90dc32157f48b3b975cb66d6a72e18 930dbd1b98664b81abe1faa69139a381
#: d937b9e96fcd4f5383fab9fbeae32c00
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"12V\". Setting this "
"GPIO low removes voltage supply to pins. By default RELAY2 is configured to "
"control this pin and sets the GPIO high on boot."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制通往标有 \"12V\" 引脚的图传 BEC 输出。将此 GPIO 置低会切断引脚供电。默认情况下 RELAY2 "
"配置为控制此引脚，并在开机时将该 GPIO 置高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:114
#: 1ab172c3c6734579866cbf4505eeb0e9 4d1a307f6ff747d791f9d7e6c41c8c98
#: 7ea8de0c22ae42a9895605693255f32d b346336bfe1f4537a656084a5400fc19
#: e98e41170c034d75a83d7d0702cafe08
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:115
#: 30442283f7824b168ebec72af4da83fa 70263054e2674368a1ec19f4c8c27721
#: a3fa1deee2ad4f8fbeab94b53d36c99d a5e66e4bfd0c40baa049127f67b85153
#: ac003158b9344c228865e49472ae8a7d
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high "
"on boot."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制通往标有 \"CAM1\" 和 \"CAM2\" 接口的摄像头输出。将此 GPIO 置低会把视频输出从 CAM1 切换到 "
"CAM2。默认情况下 RELAY3 配置为控制此引脚，并在开机时将该 GPIO 置高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:118
#: 56d66b10406244edbd6a448ad2be7f5c 90183849f31d4efb9ac8c6d0097b0b53
#: a32da3981169430eabdcaa76088d48c5 c0f2e0d4e4c640d184eda84086f5214d
#: fab66687a9f34099a5ee8b5ce0d1c0f4
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:119
#: 2a34823e113043639de1bf5126237460 59d4c0d2fe614417ae3d7c38c24ee839
#: 839d249e0fbd484a866b47005984d0d2 c9a0ca8334e4442e9731d4d95fcb2212
#: fe7a693431654a0b97e7ebab7da17c18
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled \"DAKEFPVF405\"."
msgstr ""
"这些板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 名为 \"DAKEFPVF405\" "
"的子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:121
#: 10bdffe98fc046af8001fe942cfbc1d1 b2b1edbde0024a6288d8a7d9352338b3
#: c503b39ce79e45d9b9882efc3128223c c6df8cec898942abbb5b2aec72a0b380
#: fffb50e319ea47b1aaf13cf2f73d7207
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvf405.rst:125
#: 37dbe99cebdd48d586b7594a592cc9c8 4653e9d94498402bb749e2c27ad7d6ae
#: 4d34c6200ebf4f0eaffeadd3b4357186 9dc42578f9f84d9c8d0b8c5a34adb798
#: ffd1755e5ee3499ca451665d00cc6d58
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
